WEBVTT

00:10:57.456 --> 00:11:01.826
Because fundamentally,
water security requires accountability.

00:11:02.444 --> 00:11:08.162
Accountability is not corporate polluters
sponsoring environmental groups

00:11:08.186 --> 00:11:09.995
and museums.

00:11:10.019 --> 00:11:12.059
Those are conflicts of interest.

00:11:12.083 --> 00:11:17.204
(Applause)

00:11:18.126 --> 00:11:20.205
Accountability is:

00:11:21.143 --> 00:11:25.403
making the risk of liability too expensive

00:11:25.427 --> 00:11:28.405
to continue polluting
and wasting our water.

00:11:28.429 --> 00:11:32.209
We can't keep settling for words.
It's time to act.